config PINCTRL_SF32LB57
    bool "SiFli SF32LB57 pin controller"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_SIFLI_SF32LB57_PINCTRL_ENABLED
    help
      Pin multiplexer and pad configuration of the SiFli SF32LB57 HPSYS
      pads.
